{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the released plugin ordering contract.** Reversing `onInvocationEnd` silently changes the existing `withPlugins` guarantee that hooks run in registration order. Plugin pairs coordinating flushing or shared-resource cleanup can now execute incorrectly after an upgrade. Keep forward order for existing plugins, or introduce an explicit versioned/opt-in scoped-lifecycle contract for LIFO cleanup.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-DuFJ","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"b202939312ecd9c67eaa5a0401521c556f3118ea088edb66e96eab5dcbf75aca","observation_id":"aro_v1_wibjheys5tm4m7vklicacuq4kv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aijmadpi5elrp5dx77z56tmy35","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"3fab2d713e2b248ca27f12a6569529ba46388ff6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_p2islwupyn7ppbe2i7pjurlvpz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
